WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
The Big Bang theory was first
proposed by Georges Lemaître.

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.940
Lemaître was a physicist.

3
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.230
He was also a Catholic priest.

4
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:13.370
And the Bible opens: In the beginning,
God created the heavens and the earth.

5
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.530
Genesis 1 counts out six days of creation,

6
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.320
then a day of rest.

7
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.640
So if Genesis says the
world was made in six days,

8
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:25.030
how can many Christians
also accept the Big Bang?

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.670
In this mission, you'll read two openings:

10
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.010
Genesis 1, and John's In
the beginning was the Word.

11
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:36.650
Then you'll weigh up a claim: that Christian
beliefs about creation conflict with

12
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.900
science.

13
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:43.000
Your mission: find out how many Christians
hold together Genesis and the Big Bang.
